{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021230727030-1021_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261021230727\"/><p>BBC深陷財政壓力。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>英國廣播公司（BBC）周二（20日）宣布，兩條電視頻道BBC第3台及BBC蘇格蘭台由2027年春季起停播，轉為網上播放，另外旗下Radio 4 Extra則會關閉。</p><p>BBC今春曾表示，為應對巨大經濟壓力，將裁減1,800至2,000個工作崗位，佔員工總數約十分之一，以在未來兩年內節省5億英鎊（約52.5億港元）。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:22:07.299775+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:07:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:57:43.755706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:17:45.809974+00:00","content_hash":"74e7c683912d669903c0ef5f71fb7e51660c4ca333647dc5419ae579544e7c11","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}